        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000002"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A relation that holds between a continuant c1 and a continuant c2, where c1 is required by c2 as input to work.</obo:IAO_0000115>
